O'TMISH zamonning boshlanishi:
'was/were' — 'be' ning o'tmishi;
'had' — 'have' ning o'tmishi;
'could' — 'can' ning o'tmishi.

⚠ IKKINCHI OLTI BETLI UNIT (42-47).

Past Simple — to'liq o'tmish zamon;
'the' — aniq artikl qo'shiladi;
'will' — kelajakning birinchi shakli;
'linking words' = bog'lovchilar
(and, but, because, so).

⚠ KELAJAK zamonning UCH shakli:
WILL — bashorat, o'sha zahotgi qaror;
BE GOING TO — dalilga asoslangan;
PRESENT CONTINUOUS — rejalashtirilgan.

⚠ 'IT will be' + SIFAT;
'THERE will be' + OT.

MODAL FE'LLAR:
SHOULD — maslahat;
MUST — majburiyat, MUSTN'T — taqiq;
CAN — ruxsat/qobiliyat;
COULD — o'tmish yoki muloyim shakl.

⚠ Kitobning ENG QIYIN uniti.

Present Perfect ↔ Past Simple farqi;
EVER (savolda) / NEVER (tasdiqda);
JUST, ALREADY — have va V3 orasida;
YET — gap oxirida;
FOR (davomiylik) / SINCE (nuqta).
